At t=19 player P1 with prog 1322 vs VOLT 1318, correct by progress. But visually at the screenshot (t=2.9) P2 while cars ahead may have been VOLT but only slightly, and the track direction might indeed be down-right. Let's not fix what's not broken: progress is computed from nearest centerline index; racing position by centerline progress is standard.

